  m_text: "<b>4 \xB7 THE MOTOR (Hinge Joint, Use Motor)</b>\nTwo stirrers turn at the same speed, each next to a 40 kg block.\nA: motor Force 30   B: motor Force 3000\nWhich one stalls? Compare with the kinematic sweeper in Lab 1 (station 1, lane E)."
